1:Toki Onjoji
2:{character:Toki Onjoji}(...)
3:{character:Toki Onjoji}(...Urgh... What's that clicking and clacking sound...?)
4:{character:Toki Onjoji}(...Why does it sound like the shuffling of Mahjong tiles?)
5:{character:Toki Onjoji}(...Mahjong?!)
6:After opening her eyes, she was relieved to see that she wasn't greeted by the dazzling lights of the tournament venue.
7:{character:Toki Onjoji}...P-phew.
8:The familiar feeling she has just experienced after falling into the darkness makes her think she had fainted again during a game.
9:She rubs her eyes and looks around her before her eyes stop in the direction of the Mahjong table.
10:She recognizes three of the five other people in the room.
11:The fashionable-looking one was Ako Atarashi who played against her teammate; the smirking one was the lieutenant of Kiyosumi High School; and if she remembered correctly, the one with the friendly face finished in first place in the individual competition of Nagano prefecture. As for the other two...
12:{character:Toki Onjoji}(A rabbit and... a dog?)
13:The woman wearing bunny ears and the giant stuffed plushie sitting in the position to her right makes Toki's groggy mind even more confused. She takes a deep breath to calm herself down and work out what was going on...
14:Mihoko Fukuji
15:{character:Mihoko Fukuji}Ron.
16:Kaguyahime
17:{character:Kaguyahime}Eh... Haven't you abandoned the win to focus on defense?!
18:Wanjirou
19:{character:Wanjirou}(She switched from an open wait for either side of 4 & 5 Sou to a Dual Paired wait, woof? Did this little lady break the sequence to target the rabbit, woof?)
20:Ako Atarashi
21:{character:Ako Atarashi}Miss Fukuji, you're as alert as ever about other people's tricks... Oh, you're awake, Miss Onjoji.
23:After a round of greetings, Toki hears about how she ended up here from the others.
24:{character:Toki Onjoji}I'm so sorry for bothering you. I came out for a walk because I thought I was a lot better, but I guess I was still pushing it...
25:{character:Ako Atarashi}Where's Miss Shimizudani? Why didn't she come with you?
26:{character:Toki Onjoji}Umm... I came out secretly. I was thinking of giving them a surprise by going on a stroll by myself.
27:{character:Toki Onjoji}W-what should I do? Ryuka is definitely going to be angry when she hears that I fainted again outside...
28:{character:Ako Atarashi}...What's done is done. I'll go back with you later. Just tell them I asked you out to go shopping.
29:{character:Toki Onjoji}Really? Thank you! I'll buy you some food later.
30:{character:Wanjirou}This Hanchan is over. We'll mark the points and start the next one, woof.
31:{character:Kaguyahime}I... I'm a little tired. I'm not at my best today... Why hasn't that cat returned yet...?
32:{character:Kaguyahime}Little Redhead, why don't you take my spot? No one will see it, so it won't hurt to get a little creative with the rules.
33:Hisa Takei
34:{character:Hisa Takei}Although I really want to take your place on the table, I really should be more prudent. Sorry about that.
35:{character:Kaguyahime}Tsk, so inflexible... The girl who just woke up, you know how to play Mahjong, right? I've warmed up this seat for you. Why don't you play?
36:{character:Wanjirou}I'm afraid your seat is as cold as ice after your taking the last place in a row. That girl obviously isn't feeling very well. Don't make a sick person your scapegoat, woof.
37:{character:Toki Onjoji}It's okay, I can play.
38:{character:Kaguyahime}Muhaha! See? Stupid dog! No one asked for your opinion. She can't wait to take my warm and comfy seat.
39:{character:Mihoko Fukuji}Are you sure? It would be better if you get more rest.
40:{character:Toki Onjoji}It's okay, I feel a lot better after sleeping.
41:{character:Toki Onjoji}I haven't touched any tiles recently, so I want to get back my feel in a game.
42:{character:Ako Atarashi}...Don't force yourself, okay?
43:Ako sighs inwardly after seeing Toki sit down.
44:{character:Ako Atarashi}(It was hard enough dealing with Miss Fukuji's iron-tight defense, and now I have to deal with Miss Onjoji too. I can't play like it's a casual game now...)
45:{character:Ako Atarashi}Chii!
46:{character:Kaguyahime}Isn't it better to wait a little longer with this open wait?
47:{character:Ako Atarashi}Pon!
48:{character:Wanjirou}(Woof? This little girl was using the closed hand strategy before. Why did she suddenly up the pace?)
49:{character:Mihoko Fukuji}...I better retreat.
50:{character:Hisa Takei}(Mihoko is discarding safe tiles from her hand... which means Miss Atarashi already has Tenpai.)
51:Hisa is correct. After one round, Ako pushes down her tiles.
52:{character:Ako Atarashi}Tsumo! All Simples, Mixed Triple Sequence, Dora 2, that's 7,900 points.
53:{character:Wanjirou}Those tiles look very soothing, woof. Ichihime really needs to learn from you. Playing an All Simples hand isn't about throwing the tiles around vigorously like she usually does.
54:{character:Ako Atarashi}Miss Kaguyahime was right, I could wait a little longer with this these tiles, but...
55:{character:Wanjirou}But what?
56:{character:Ako Atarashi}Nothing. It's my turn to be the dealer.
57:Although well-paced tile calls are the greatest feature of Ako Atarashi's game, she increased the speed as a precaution against the person who just joined the game.
58:{character:Toki Onjoji}...
59:{character:Ako Atarashi}(To stop Miss Onjoji, all I can do is to win as soon as possible to increase my advantage before she starts taking action.)
60:After grabbing a tile, Ako scans it and sees a hand with 1 complete Mentsu and 2 good Tenpai options. Although she doesn't have a pair yet, she is happy with what she has.
61:{character:Ako Atarashi}(Very good, this hand isn't bad as the dealer. I'll tile call first and attack quickly to keep my position as the dealer.)
62:{character:Toki Onjoji}Riichi.
63:{character:Ako Atarashi}Eh? O-oh no...
64:{character:Mihoko Fukuji}(Toki Onjoji... If I remember correctly, her Riichi...
65:{character:Hisa Takei}(Like Saki, she's a very special girl.)
66:{character:Toki Onjoji}Tsumo.
67:{character:Kaguyahime}Ehhh?! Is this for real? She managed an Ippatsu Tsumo with such a lousy Tenpai?!
68:{character:Ako Atarashi}My... My dealer round...
69:And now for the next...
70:{character:Toki Onjoji}...Riichi.
71:{character:Wanjirou}Woof woof?! Again?! Also how does that point stick stay upwards like that? Woof...
72:No one can change fate.
104:
